<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">BRING GOOD FOOD HOME</view><view class="title">这次，需要买这些</view><picker mode="date" value="{{week}}" bindchange="changeWeek"><view class="field">菜单日期：{{week}}</view></picker><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="card"><view class="muted">{{missingPrices?'已知价格小计':'预计买菜花费'}}</view><view class="money">¥ {{total}}</view><view class="muted">{{missingPrices?missingPrices+' 项还没填价格':'按当前单价与库存估算，实际结账可能不同'}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!plan}}" class="empty">提交菜单后，就能看到采购清单。<button class="secondary" bindtap="menu">先去点菜</button></view><view wx:if="{{missingRecipes.length}}" class="notice">以下菜品待补配方：{{missingRecipes}}</view><view wx:if="{{plan.extra}}" class="notice">额外想吃：{{plan.extra}}<view class="muted">未纳入采购计算，请大厨补菜谱。</view></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="key"><view class="row between"><view class="grow {{item.checked?'check':''}}"><view class="heading">{{item.name}}</view><view>买 {{item.buy}} {{item.unit}}</view><view class="muted">需要 {{item.need}} {{item.unit}} · 家里有 {{item.stock}} {{item.unit}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.cost===null?'待补价格':'预计 ¥ '+item.cost}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{role==='cook'}}" class="small" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="check" disabled="{{busy}}">{{item.checked?'已买':'买好了'}}</button></view><button wx:if="{{role==='cook'}}" class="secondary" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="edit">改价格 / 库存</button></view><view wx:if="{{editing}}" class="card"><view class="heading">{{editing.name}} · {{editing.unit}}</view><text class="label">家里还有多少（{{editing.unit}}）</text><input type="digit" value="{{editing.stock}}" data-key="stock" bindinput="field" /><text class="label">价格（元，留空表示未知）</text><input type="digit" value="{{editing.price}}" data-key="price" bindinput="field" /><text class="label">以上价格对应多少 {{editing.unit}}</text><input type="digit" value="{{editing.priceUnit}}" data-key="priceUnit" bindinput="field" /><text class="label">一包多少 {{editing.unit}}（散买填 0）</text><input type="digit" value="{{editing.packageSize}}" data-key="packageSize" bindinput="field" /><view class="row"><button class="secondary grow" bindtap="cancel">取消</button><button class="primary grow" bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">保存</button></view></view><view class="footer">采购数量已扣减库存。价格单位要对应，比如每500克多少钱。勾选“已买”不自动增加库存，避免重复计算。</view></view>